{"id":"n14269-2-8","stage":2,"title":"애정 · 爱情","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14269-2-8-1","ko":"그 사람은 왜 나를 떠났을까?","zh":"那个人为什么离开我呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个。","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"사람은","meaning":"人（그 사람：那个人）","explanation":"사람：人（그 사람：那个人）；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람은","audio":"/audio/987448c10afe56108009.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"나를","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나를","audio":"/audio/4225b1c78642e45b4068.mp3"}},{"text":"떠났을까?","meaning":"离开，离去","explanation":"떠나다：离开，离去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"떠나다","audio":"/audio/9ee56e8783da00e3fbed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53746","senseId":"2","lemma":"떠나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떠났을까","audio":"/audio/113bc8ba7bafe22c3982.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代与听话人较近或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人（그 사람：那个人）","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"人（그 사람：那个人）","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"9ee56e8783da00e3","term":"떠나다","zh":"离开，离去","audio":"/audio/9ee56e8783da00e3fbed.mp3","entryId":"53746","definition":"为了到别的地方，脱离所在地。","pronunciation":["떠나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6f08931d3eb07645e766.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14269-2-8-2","ko":"너에 대한 애정이 식은 거겠지.","zh":"大概是对你的感情变淡了吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너에","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너에","audio":"/audio/25bcbf8a92d82698c52a.mp3"}},{"text":"대한","meaning":"对，对于","explanation":"대하다：对，对于；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"대하다","audio":"/audio/4033b88da1605ad4f103.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86300","senseId":"3","lemma":"대하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대한","audio":"/audio/1d9b6fadeae799dde72f.mp3"}},{"text":"애정이","meaning":"爱情，恋情","explanation":"애정：爱情，恋情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"애정","audio":"/audio/e1198a9150b43ead9e98.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14269","senseId":"2","lemma":"애정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"애정이","audio":"/audio/877d9da97cafc9b55f0d.mp3"}},{"text":"식은","meaning":"消退，减退","explanation":"식다：消退，减退；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"식다","audio":"/audio/6ae572e959621a79ba3c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30204","senseId":"2","lemma":"식다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"식은","audio":"/audio/1f2be88d3f6e90727c8b.mp3"}},{"text":"거겠지.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거겠지","audio":"/audio/a853a6c227b38beb0658.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"4033b88da1605ad4","term":"대하다","zh":"对，对于","audio":"/audio/4033b88da1605ad4f103.mp3","entryId":"86300","definition":"当作对象或对方。","pronunciation":["대ː하다"]},{"id":"e1198a9150b43ead","term":"애정","zh":"爱情，恋情","audio":"/audio/e1198a9150b43ead9e98.mp3","entryId":"14269","definition":"男女之间相互思想、喜欢的心。","pronunciation":["애ː정"]},{"id":"6ae572e959621a79","term":"식다","zh":"消退，减退","audio":"/audio/6ae572e959621a79ba3c.mp3","entryId":"30204","definition":"感情或感觉等变弱。","pronunciation":["식따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/4431ca2adb168fa6fe33.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.26,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14269","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":76,"sequenceScore":2.0867,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["大概是对你的感情变淡了吧。","那个人为什么离开我呢？","那本小说的内容大致是怎样的呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那个人为什么离开我呢？","那本小说的内容大致是怎样的呢？","大概是对你的感情变淡了吧。"],"answer":2}]}
